WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.789 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  kelsey ballerini is putting her heart  first the country star has filed for  divorce from fellow country singer  morgan evans after nearly five years of  marriage people magazine broke the news  with a source saying they've been  working on their marriage for a very  long time prior to this they had  separated privately once before and have  been in therapy for several years they  gave it their best go but unfortunately  arrived at the decision to formally  separate  and shortly after the news broke kelsey  shared an emotional statement on her  instagram writing friends i've always  tried my best to share my life with you  in a real and vulnerable way while also  protecting layers of my personal life as  they unfold this is now public records  so i wanted you to hear from me directly  that i am going through a divorce kelsey  also added that this deeply difficult  decision is the result of a journey of  love growth and effort that ultimately  has come to an end it's hard to find the  words here but i feel extremely grateful  for the years of marriage to morgan and  hopeful for the next seasons with very  active schedules coming up please be  mindful that we are both fragile  actively healing and showing up the best  we can morgan followed suit with his own  statement on instagram confirming kelsey  and i are parting ways i wish it were  otherwise but sadly it is not now the  pair first met back in march of 2016  while co-hosting the cmc music awards in  australia they got engaged that december  on christmas day and exchanged vows in  mexico a year later and kelsey and  morgan made their final red carpet  appearance together as a couple at the  2022 academy of country music awards  back in march this news also comes as  kelsey is gearing up for the upcoming  release of her fifth album subject to  change on september 23rd the material is  set to embody her growth as an artist  while displaying how she has adapted to  change throughout the years  and when we last caught up with kelsey  back in 2020 she opened up about the ups  and downs she and morgan faced as a  couple while forced to spend more time  together at home during the cobin 19  pandemic  we've obviously never had this much time  together we  met as two touring artists and so our  whole relationship has been built on  trying to cram in everything within one  or two days a week of being together and  so it's definitely  been challenging but it's been so  wonderful for us to actually have the  time to exist together and  to get into this rhythm of like what  it's like to be under the same roof and  living together seven days a week it's  it's kind of been five years of marriage  in five months but it's been really  healthy for us and um i definitely feel  like we have a new appreciation for each  other  you

